{"id":3534,"date":"2026-03-29T10:13:53","date_gmt":"2026-03-29T10:13:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/?p=3534"},"modified":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","modified_gmt":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","slug":"fire-damage-assessment","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/fire-damage-assessment\/","title":{"rendered":"Fire Damage Assessment"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introduction<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fire exposure can significantly alter the properties of construction materials, particularly concrete and steel. Even when damage is not visibly severe, structural performance may be compromised.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A detailed assessment is required to determine whether the structure can be repaired or needs replacement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Fire Damage Assessment<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fire damage assessment evaluates the impact of high temperatures on structural elements and determines the extent of damage.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Approach<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Visual Inspection<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Assessment of discoloration, cracking, and deformation caused by heat exposure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Material Testing<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Testing is conducted to evaluate changes in strength and material properties.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Heat Exposure Analysis<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The extent and intensity of fire exposure are evaluated to identify affected zones.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Structural Evaluation<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Structural performance is assessed to determine safety and usability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Repair Strategy Development<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Appropriate repair or strengthening measures are recommended.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Scope of Services<\/h2>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94:not(.this-stops-third-party-issues){margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94 ul.kt-svg-icon-list:not(.this-prevents-issues):not(.this-stops-third-party-issues):not(.tijsloc){margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);margin-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94 ul.kt-svg-icon-list{grid-row-gap:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap .kt-svg-icon-list-single{margin-right:10px;}.kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-level-0 .kt-svg-icon-list-single svg{font-size:20px;}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-iconlist kt-svg-icon-list-items kt-svg-icon-list-items3534_2196e8-94 kt-svg-icon-list-columns-1 alignnone\"><ul class=\"kt-svg-icon-list\"><style>.kt-svg-icon-list-item-3534_a11465-61 .kt-svg-icon-list-text mark.kt-highlight{background-color:unset;font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}<\/style>\n<li class=\"wp-block-kadence-listitem kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-3534_a11465-61\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_checkCircle kt-svg-icon-list-single\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">Visual inspection and damage mapping<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n<style>.kt-svg-icon-list